# Rocky Roads: "This land enters tapped unless you control a Mount or Vehicle" (CR 614.1d), and "{1}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice this land:
# Create a 1/1 colorless Pilot creature token ... Activate only as a sorcery" (CR 602.5d, 111.1). Bot1 pays {2} for a
# Smuggler's Copter, a Vehicle (CR 301.7), with Mox Ruby and Mox Sapphire, so the land enters untapped. With {W}{B} from Mox
# Pearl and Mox Jet, two mana but no red, the sacrifice is refused for its cost. On turn 3 it is refused in the upkeep,
# though the Moxen could pay, and made in the main phase with {R}{W}, all of which it spends: the land goes to the
# graveyard and a Pilot token arrives.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Smuggler's Copter
Rocky Roads
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

